After opening a pull request and the CI check :guilabel:`docs/readthedocs.org:icalendar` succeeds, navigate to view documentation changes by either of the following routes.

-   `View all builds of documentation on Read the Docs <https://app.readthedocs.org/projects/icalendar/builds/>`_.
    Click the appropriate pull request and view its documentation.
-   Under the list of CI checks, click the link :guilabel:`docs/readthedocs.org:icalendar`.
